{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 9,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.023799896240234,
        35.701358795166016,
        142.9498291015625,
        53.701358795166016
      ],
      "text": "FOREWORD",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 18.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.023799896240234,
        66.27603149414062,
        408.7193908691406,
        75.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "Tuberculosis (TB) contacts are people who have close contact with patients with infectious TB.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.17679977416992,
        78.27304077148438,
        408.36846923828125,
        87.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "As they are at high risk for infection (and in line with the Stop TB strategy), TB contacts should",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.203800201416016,
        90.27005004882812,
        408.16192626953125,
        99.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "be investigated systematically and actively for TB infection and disease. Such interventions",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.987796783447266,
        102.26705932617188,
        408.0085144042969,
        111.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "are called ‘tuberculosis contact investigations’. They contribute to early identiﬁcation of active",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.84379959106445,
        114.13977813720703,
        408.1825866699219,
        123.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "Mycobacterium tuberculosis TB, thus decreasing its severity and reducing transmission of   to",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.017635345458984,
        126.27304077148438,
        373.1185302734375,
        135.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "others, and identiﬁcation of latent TB infection (LTBI), to allow preventive measures.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.0356330871582,
        144.27304077148438,
        408.41680908203125,
        153.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "Contacts are commonly investigated in high-income countries with low TB burdens and in",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.24263381958008,
        156.27005004882812,
        408.49798583984375,
        165.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "settings in which a TB elimination policy is implemented, in order to identify persons with",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.32363510131836,
        168.26705932617188,
        408.2004699707031,
        177.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "early active TB or who have recently been infected. People identiﬁed as infected are then",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.0266227722168,
        180.27304077148438,
        408.2272033691406,
        189.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "treated for LTBI with isoniazid for at least 6 months (usually 9 months) or with shorter",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.062625885009766,
        192.27001953125,
        276.0191955566406,
        201.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "combination regimens including isoniazid and rifampicin.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.064212799072266,
        210.27001953125,
        408.8138427734375,
        219.27001953125
      ],
      "text": "TB contact investigations are rarely and inconsistently carried out in resource-limited settings.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.27121353149414,
        222.26702880859375,
        408.4899597167969,
        231.26702880859375
      ],
      "text": "In most low- and middle-income countries, it is included in the national policy to control and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.32521438598633,
        234.2640380859375,
        408.1748962402344,
        243.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "prevent TB; however, in the vast majority of countries, it is either not undertaken or is",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.0012321472168,
        246.27005004882812,
        408.2380676269531,
        255.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "implemented on the basis of no or poor standards, because of the absence of clear deﬁnitions",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.06423568725586,
        258.2670593261719,
        408.08544921875,
        267.2670593261719
      ],
      "text": "of index cases, contacts and procedures. Furthermore, the health personnel who should be",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.92023849487305,
        270.2640686035156,
        407.96173095703125,
        279.2669372558594
      ],
      "text": "involved are usually not clearly identiﬁed. Information on the contribution of routine contact",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.92300033569336,
        282.2639465332031,
        408.6485290527344,
        291.2758483886719
      ],
      "text": "investigations to early TB case detection is scarce in these countries or is non-standardized,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.04262924194336,
        294.2728576660156,
        325.0115051269531,
        303.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "thus precluding an assessment of its impact on reducing transmission.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.051631927490234,
        312.2728576660156,
        408.1264953613281,
        321.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "Many studies in countries with a high TB incidence have shown that the prevalence may reach",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.952632904052734,
        324.2698669433594,
        408.1539611816406,
        333.2698669433594
      ],
      "text": "5% or more among contacts, particularly among household members. Other data suggest that",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.1146354675293,
        336.2668762207031,
        408.74755859375,
        345.2668762207031
      ],
      "text": "contact investigations could be particularly useful for identifying childhood TB. Furthermore,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.14163589477539,
        348.2638854980469,
        408.2436218261719,
        357.27288818359375
      ],
      "text": "contact investigation can help identify people who require careful follow-up, such as those",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.07865524291992,
        360.2698974609375,
        408.2560119628906,
        369.27264404296875
      ],
      "text": "who were exposed to an index case of multi-drug-resistant or extensively drug-resistant TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.08220291137695,
        372.2696533203125,
        378.2951354980469,
        381.2696533203125
      ],
      "text": "or people infected with HIV, whose risk for rapid progression to active TB is very high.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.10020065307617,
        390.2696533203125,
        408.28314208984375,
        399.2696533203125
      ],
      "text": "Effective investigation of TB contacts within national TB programmes and other services can",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.10920333862305,
        402.26666259765625,
        408.6520080566406,
        411.2756652832031
      ],
      "text": "result in the detection of a signiﬁcant number of cases. WHO estimates show that, worldwide,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.03719711303711,
        414.2726745605469,
        410.3709716796875,
        423.2726745605469
      ],
      "text": "highly infectious, smear-positive pulmonary TB develops in over 4 million people annually.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.244197845458984,
        426.2696838378906,
        408.66094970703125,
        435.2696838378906
      ],
      "text": "If we assume that each of these patients has at least three close contacts, such as in their",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.49619674682617,
        438.2666320800781,
        408.7225036621094,
        447.2666931152344
      ],
      "text": "household, and that the prevalence of active TB among the close contacts is 2.5%, the number",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.5576057434082,
        450.2636413574219,
        409.12738037109375,
        459.2636413574219
      ],
      "text": "of early TB cases that could be identiﬁed among close contacts is at least 300 000 per year.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.5846061706543,
        462.2606201171875,
        408.26324462890625,
        471.27862548828125
      ],
      "text": "Early identiﬁcation means a better chance of cure and, especially, a reduction in further",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.09860610961914,
        474.2756042480469,
        408.2811279296875,
        483.2756042480469
      ],
      "text": "transmission. Furthermore, contact investigation allows identiﬁcation of people who are",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.11660385131836,
        486.2689514160156,
        354.5746765136719,
        495.2726135253906
      ],
      "text": "latently infected and at high risk for active TB, who can be treated preventively.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.13070297241211,
        504.2689514160156,
        408.51116943359375,
        513.2689819335938
      ],
      "text": "This WHO policy document was prepared to guide national TB programme staff and all agencies",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.337703704833984,
        516.2659912109375,
        408.13348388671875,
        525.2749633789062
      ],
      "text": "and organizations involved in TB prevention, care and control to establish strategies for sound",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.968685150146484,
        528.27197265625,
        407.8094482421875,
        537.27197265625
      ],
      "text": "TB contact investigation practices. The document was elaborated after an extensive literature",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.64468765258789,
        540.2689819335938,
        407.7823486328125,
        549.2689819335938
      ],
      "text": "review and with contributions from experts around the world. It states the funda mental",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.6176872253418,
        552.2659301757812,
        407.58453369140625,
        561.2659301757812
      ],
      "text": "principles and procedures for an appropriate approach to TB contact investigation, and annexes",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.41068649291992,
        564.262939453125,
        407.4404296875,
        573.262939453125
      ],
      "text": "1 and 2 provide further details to understand these principles. The hope is that these evidence-",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.067684173583984,
        576.2689819335938,
        408.24127197265625,
        585.2689819335938
      ],
      "text": "based guidelines will be translated into country policy and practice, so that an additional",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.07668685913086,
        588.2659301757812,
        398.3657531738281,
        597.2694702148438
      ],
      "text": "neglected intervention can be put in place and, ultimately, contribute to elimination of TB.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        344.4035949707031,
        613.371826171875,
        408.1910400390625,
        620.871826171875
      ],
      "text": "Dr Mario Raviglione",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        224.13360595703125,
        625.371826171875,
        408.213623046875,
        632.871826171875
      ],
      "text": "Director, Stop TB Department, World Health Organization",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        227.90609741210938,
        651.9745483398438,
        231.34860229492188,
        659.4745483398438
      ],
      "text": "7",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}